{"about_the_game":"Trials of Fire is a tactical, deck-building adventure game set in a fantasy world in ruin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/855a923b073f3726cd983dc0cb63501c.poster.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/855a923b073f3726cd983dc0cb63501c.webm?t=1729043034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/855a923b073f3726cd983dc0cb63501c.mp4?t=1729043034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Savage combat and tough decisions await in the unforgiving wastelands of Ashe.<br><br>Trials of Fire combines overworld exploration, multi-character combat and loot linked deck-building to create fresh strategic options on every run. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/cbf44772a8187908ac6deb129dbb568f.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=344 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content added during Early Access</h2><br>9 Playable Heroes<br>4 Game Modes + 1 Seasonal Quest<br>4 Lore Quests<br>345 Skill Cards<br>220 Items<br>42 Legendary Items<br>294 Narrative Encounters<br>56 Enemy Types<br>14 Bosses<br>40 Landmarks<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/cf1c8de0c5aac21a712b656ba78c311c.poster.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/cf1c8de0c5aac21a712b656ba78c311c.webm?t=1729043034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/cf1c8de0c5aac21a712b656ba78c311c.mp4?t=1729043034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/551538d90d4d964f812b2478cbfcda54.poster.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/551538d90d4d964f812b2478cbfcda54.webm?t=1729043034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Issue combat commands to each Hero based on their cards. <br>The combination of 3 Hero decks presents new and interesting challenges in every fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/57cd2b8d745388b7b771312ee5c3f063.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=344 /></span><br><br>Movement and positional play are critical to survival in combat.<br>Use powerful card synergies to combine the unique abilities of your three heroes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/2b302b6b970b4f39f13f34eee8c859bd.poster.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/2b302b6b970b4f39f13f34eee8c859bd.webm?t=1729043034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/e158aba5b61c5d79fd8e4c34673ac553.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=344 /></span><br><br>Outside of combat encounters, the party's loadout of weapons, items and gear can be swapped or upgraded.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/39ddd4b7214ba13eaff6e992aadd17a7.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=344 /></span><br><br>New items and weapons are discovered while exploring the vast overworld of Ashe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/e288fb3bdf16590f17016de021679f70.poster.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/e288fb3bdf16590f17016de021679f70.webm?t=1729043034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Traverse an immense overworld map and author a unique adventure in a dangerous hunt for resources critical to the survival of Terralin. <br><br>Every journey you take will be a Trial.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1038370/extras/b2a49ce11d85b6a682d9bd9407c16685.avif?t=1729043034\" width=614 height=344 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Milk Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1038370/cd6148bd17cd21ca76d83f13e35546f644d6a993.jpg"},{"name":"Gauntlet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1038370/5862d64381e3e9189939ec9145c420e19995ba7e.jpg"},{"name":"Trial of Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1038370/f52f5b0eb1d473e22b6f9270f718ff7ca44e995c.jpg"},{"name":"Scraped Through","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1038370/674836be4d15c52e5a43776969f145ea41083cd5.jpg"},{"name":"Assassin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1038370/c9fd3c36a340be57b7129777acb04e59d07f7295.jpg"},{"name":"Awoken","path":"https: